/// Reports for the debug screens (`ResultsDebugScreens`).
///
/// They are real `SpeakerReport`s: the Kit's own simulated speaker (a healthy speaker with a 72-110 Hz buzz and a
/// 14 kHz roll-off; a healthy one; recordings that were clipped and drowned out) was run through `RunAnalyzer`
/// and `SpeakerDiagnosis`, three runs each, and the encoded reports are kept here, with the numbers rounded to
/// three decimals to keep the file small. The words, the findings and the portrait are exactly what the Kit made.
